# Hall
tags: heroes, benchmark
stimulus: Five rounds of heavy cleans, a sprint and kettlebell snatches, with rest built in.
note: The kettlebell snatches are 10 per arm. The original posting gives men's loads only; the women's loads are the commonly used ones.
5 rounds for time
  3 Clean 225/155 lb
  200 m Sprint
  20 Kettlebell snatch 1.5/1 pood ("10 each arm")
  Rest 2:00
